WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.820
My name is Kurata sana, first year
junior high school student.

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.360
Aoki-Award winning writer, Mama
and squirrel Maro-chan.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.580
My manager, driver and
ex-boyfriend Rei-kun.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.240
- The amazing bat, Babbit.
- Babi Babi.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:46.210
Hayama Akito, a passionate loner
and my good friend.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:50.080
Matsui Fuka, my best friend who I
met in the bathroom with an Osaka accent.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.130
What a headache...

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.760
What to do? What to do?

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:57.260
What should I write?
I'm stalling!

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:00.350
Turn, turn, fly, fly...
I bump, I bump...

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:04.680
Sana, we're going shopping.
Do you want anything?

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.310
Is there anything I want?

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:09.060
Yeah, I want dreams, and hopes for
the future...

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:14.280
A happy family, a Babbit doll, Indian curry and papaya cooked the Chinese way...

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:15.570
Let's go...

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:17.320
Just kidding!

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.200
Here, I hope it isn't too much
trouble...

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.830
Is it a love letter to your boyfriend?

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.830
But she didn't write anything.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:25.790
No, no way! It's a friend,
furthermore, she's a girl!

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.870
Her name's Matsui Fuka, and she has
a very strong personality.

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.880
Alright, we only have to put it in
the mailbox, right?

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:36.670
Thank you very much! Very much!

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.050
Naozumi...

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.270
The atmosphere is nice, but it's
time for a scene change...

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:52.860
Pretend to be
a Boyfriend for Sushi

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:56.190
What is Hayama doing?

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.780
What did you say?

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:03.200
What I mean by boyfriend is...

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:06.120
Please pretend to be my boyfriend...

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.830
Pretend?

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.080
What I'm trying to say is...

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.210
About the joy of the dried squid
who caught a flounder...

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.460
That's not it...

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.260
Do you want to hear me say it,
Hayama-kun?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.380
Stop making excuses,
hurry up and say it...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:25.970
Last night

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.850
Hmm... Last night...

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.060
Umm...
this is my spot...

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.220
Hey, Yumi-chan, how are you?

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.890
Haven't seen you for a long time, uh huh...

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.940
How have you been...
No such thing...

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.240
Are you listening?

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.320
What was that about?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:44.780
This Sunday, five or six friends
from Osaka want to come to hang out with me...

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.990
I didn't hear any mention of this!

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:51.910
Shibuya, Harajuku, Tokyo bus station,
restrooms... I don't know exactly...

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.420
So I want you to come with me...

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.550
and pretend to be my boyfriend.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:01.720
So what does this have to do
with me?

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:05.010
Takaishi-kun is coming too...

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.680
Takaishi...?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.640
Yes... Takaishi-kun...

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.980
It's you who destroyed my
relationship with Takaishi-kun...

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.940
...and he's bringing his girlfriend...

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.810
Are you listening?

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.400
It's hard to let go, right?

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:24.160
It's your fault... He told me he
likes me, but made another girlfriend...

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:27.370
- It was that serious...?
- Don't bother to ask...

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.990
Are you feeling well?

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.910
How dare he... How dare he...!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.290
Does a guy have to have a girlfriend?!

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.580
Rock, paper, scissors...

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.040
Is it so lonely? Why can't they
tolerate loneliness...?

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.920
This makes me so mad!

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:43.590
I want to show him that I can get a new boyfriend too and be happy without him...

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:47.350
Takaishi-kun? Takaishi-kun who?

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:49.260
I want him to feel how it is...

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.720
So please help me?!! Huh?!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.350
Why don't you just let go of your
pride and go by yourself?

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.900
I need to 'save face'...

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:59.020
...That's why I begged you, IDIOT!

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:03.400
And... your reputation in school is
being a cool guy of few words...

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.780
I'm relying on you!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:08.830
Let Takaishi-kun see how cool you are...

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.040
Cool? Few words?

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.290
Seems like it...

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.670
How stupid!

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.790
You still won't help me?

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.380
I've begged you so much,
you still won't help me?

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.670
You really won't do it?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.050
No... too much trouble...

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.010
- I'll call...
- No need...

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.140
- my uncle...
- Doesn't matter...

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.720
- in Tokyo...
- None of my damn business...

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.520
...with a sushi shop.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.730
Sushi?

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:38.940
You can have all the sushi
you want!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.110
I accept!!

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.230
I'm very surprised...

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.280
What? Fuka-chan's boyfriend?

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.280
Pretend...

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:51.830
Pretend? I never thought you'd
agree to something like that...

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.160
Tsuyoshi-kun's eating chestnuts
tonight?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.870
I was bribed with sushi...

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.080
Akito-kun...

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.210
What?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.590
Is it really just because of sushi?

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:01.920
What are you trying to say?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.510
Fuka-chan and Sana-chan look alike,
don't they?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.630
So what?

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:11.470
So maybe Fuka-chan's
also your type, right?

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:13.890
What is this finger doing?
This finger here...

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:17.440
Maybe that's why you agreed to be
her boyfriend?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.860
It's not that simple!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.230
Wait up, Akito-kun...

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:28.530
Still, Fuka-chan is also an
interesting person.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.570
She likes to say interesting
things...

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.490
Interesting?

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.910
Akito-kun, I'm a little worried...

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.830
The eggs aren't broken...

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:41.460
So Hayama pretends to be Fuka's
boyfriend

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.000
I'm here!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.260
Hayama...

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.930
Good morning!

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.260
You kept your promise.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:56.970
- If I promise something...
- Usually doesn't come through.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:57.930
...I'll keep it.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:02.310
- The person who was pushing you before...?
- That was Babbit!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:05.820
Am I overdoing it? Even if...

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.400
...it's ok to trick Takaishi-kun,
is it ok to trick others?

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.360
Now, you say this...

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.780
Mind your own business, get lost!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.200
Ok, then I'm going...

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.790
Wait!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.750
- Sushi!
- No problem!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.290
Thank you!
I'm for real, this is it!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.960
I know... don't bow.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:27.880
But later, don't say a word,
just keep quiet... ok?

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.550
There isn't much to say.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:32.300
Alright, now we're the driver's seat!

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.600
She's indeed an interesting person.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.140
Fuka!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.470
They're here!

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:41.560
Haven't seen you in a while...
How've you been?

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:46.610
- Are all the people from Osaka like this?
- Welcome!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.490
Fuka hasn't changed a bit!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.030
How are you feeling?

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.450
I'm fine, I haven't changed at all.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.240
What? I thought you must have
changed to a Tokyo accent by now!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.750
- Where is Takaishi-kun?
- Over there...

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.040
Everyone is so excited...

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:06.710
That girl...

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.500
She's Takaishi-kun's girlfriend...

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.170
Her name's Shizu-chan Yuno...

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.720
She's a very quiet girl...

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.390
Yeah, I haven't heard her speak
the whole day...

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:19.180
She was in the same elementary
school, but different class.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:22.440
Does it bother you that Takaishi
brought her?

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:25.310
I'm fine, I'm fine, it doesn't
matter anymore...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:29.150
Besides... how should I say this...
I already have one...

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:34.280
I have a boyfriend, let me
introduce you, Hayama...

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.070
Fuka's boyfriend?

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.370
She already has another one?

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.990
He's cute!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.540
Hey, Fuka brought her boyfriend!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.750
She's here? Boyfriend?

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.500
Let's go see!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.050
- Let's go.
- Ok.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:57.300
You guys haven't changed!
How are you?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.060
You're Hayama-kun?
Nice to meet you.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:02.770
Haven't seen you guys in a while!
How are you?!

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.650
Long time... no see...

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.440
Yeah, long time no see...

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.650
Fuka! Let's talk while we walk!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.780
Good idea!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.610
Let's go to Harajuku!

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.280
Yeah, we'll talk while we walk!

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.950
Which way?

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.290
How long will it take?

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.710
About twenty minutes...

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.960
- Hayama-kun...
- doesn't talk much.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.050
I told you to not talk so much...

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.920
but if you're completely quiet,
they'll think it's strange.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.630
I'm counting on you!

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:41.350
If you proceed this way,
it'll take this much time.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.940
Arrived at Harajuku!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.730
Here! Here!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:53.110
Harajuku, Harajuku!
Harahara! Jukujuku!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.440
Fuka, I want to go to this shop...

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.820
Where? Where?

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.200
So this is Takaishi-kun...

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.330
He has an unreadable face...

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.590
What happened?

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.800
You... what did you do that for?

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.140
Stop staring at me,
it makes me uncomfortable...

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.430
What's going on?

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.180
Rock, paper, scissors...

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.770
This guy is so...

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.520
Takaishi-kun,
it's my boyfriend's fault...

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.530
pardon him... ok?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:42.200
I finally told him!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.410
Never mind... not a big deal...

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:50.960
I finally got to say words 'my
boyfriend' to Takaishi-kun!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.670
I've always wanted to say that!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.300
But... why...

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.760
why does this feel like I've
been freed?

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:04.430
He still likes you,
doesn't he?

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.070
Lead
role

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:15.320
My appearing in this
drama is too little!

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:19.150
What's the Kasao?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:24.160
That's Osaka.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.120
This scene was done before
the commercial.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:34.130
Staying in this posture is tiring...

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.670
What were you saying, Hayama?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:38.710
He has something
against your boyfriend.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:42.260
- Your... boyfriend.
- Even if it's pretend...

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.470
Don't say things like this!

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:48.180
Takaishi-kun already has
a girlfriend...

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:50.600
Her name's Shizu-chan...

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.440
Maybe... she's also a fake...

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:57.400
It can't be... they're pretending to be dating and we are too...

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.440
And Takaishi is mad at you because the truth is he still likes me...

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.860
Shizu-chan is very quiet.
You like to eat sushi...

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.870
If we're in Tokyo we should... go to the Tokyo Tower...

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.910
Takaishi-kun's feelings for me...

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.370
Hayama... Tokyo tower...

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:14.080
Ahhh... My brain is fried...

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.170
I'm getting dizzy...

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:19.000
You're not feeling well?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.510
Since yesterday I've been thinking
about this because of stress...

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.970
What should you boyfriend do at a time like this?

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:28.140
I don't know, you decide.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.020
If you want to puke, puke here...

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.480
What? You want me to puke?

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.440
Don't you want me to say it
this way?

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:40.570
No way! Thanks to you I've overcome my lethargy.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.280
Fuka's relationship is going
so well...

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.320
How passionate...

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:48.080
You call that passionate?

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.250
Tsuyoshi-kun and I are passionate, right?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.370
I don't feel good...

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.000
If Akito-kun becomes serious,
it'll be bad...

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.000
Is this different from being unhappy?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.880
Just follow quietly, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.190
Where should we go next?

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:19.230
I'm hungry...
Let's find a place to rest.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.690
You're right. We've been walking
for quiet a while.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.950
What do you guys wanna eat? I'm fine with anything.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.360
I'd like to the Spaghetti!

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.320
Yakisoba!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.160
Honkonomiaki!

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:33.330
What a headache... everyone wants
something different...

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.500
I want to eat Katsu-don.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.960
Katsu-don is more...

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.590
We don't have that...

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.710
Others are fine.

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.260
I'll have curry steak then.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.050
That's also the steak!

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.680
Here.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:57.850
So... We ended up here.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:59.860
The steak burger!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:05.110
Both Matsui and Takaishi
are not talking at all.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:11.370
You both have someone else now so
you should be able to speak normally...

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.330
After all you don't see each
other much.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.210
What? I didn't...

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:20.710
- The fries are good.
- The steak burger is not bad either.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:24.340
In sixth grade, you guys used to
get along so well.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.920
- Fuka...
- Takaishi-kun...

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.560
Matsui has a boyfriend...

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:43.480
Takaishi-kun was in shock when
he heard that...

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:47.320
So you know what happened to him
afterward...

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.780
Idiot! Stop saying all that!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.450
But it's the truth, Matsui...

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:56.540
Someone said I... I had a boyfriend...
when?

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.460
The end of sixth grade...

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.710
When was the end of sixth grade?
Who did say that?

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.790
How did I have a boyfriend?

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.630
I don't know...

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:07.460
The rumor was running wild...

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:11.260
Rumor? What kind of rumor?

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:16.180
Back then, someone said that you
already had your first kiss, isn't it true?

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:22.560
That's why people said you had
a boyfriend, right?

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:27.530
I did say I had my first kiss...

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.900
But... but... but...

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:32.910
It happened in kindergarten!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.780
Kindergarten?!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:39.120
Then the rumor about a boyfriend...

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.620
It was false...

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:47.460
Takaishi-kun, so the reason you
started avoiding me...

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.420
back then is because of the rumor...

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:57.350
Matsui, you didn't say anything about it.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.390
What did you say?!

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.940
Except for hamburgers, there isn't
anything else...

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.900
and you have to wait for such
a long time...

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:07.690
I couldn't say anything because
you were avoiding me!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.610
Dummy!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:14.410
So there really wasn't any problem
between you two?

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.120
So you didn't have to break up...

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.000
It escaped...

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.620
Ma-Matsui...

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.960
F-Fu...

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.210
Forget it!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:31.010
Takaishi-kun and I both have
someone else now!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.760
It's all in the past.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:42.430
Look, it's a cute postcard of
Zenjiro...

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:45.770
Thank you. You're cute also.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.190
Should I buy it?

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.320
You really like to shop too much.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:52.570
No such thing.
I'm rather good looking.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.070
Hey, look!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:57.700
Kurata Sana, I like her too!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.700
Wait, wait!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.660
Please! Wait!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.660
I do look a little like her, and
we're good friends in school.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.790
Don't waste your acting talent on me.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.540
I'm going to buy it!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.630
Fuka-san...

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.340
Huh? Shizu-chan?
Do you want something?

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:18.140
Please don't
take Takaishi-kun away from me!

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:23.680
I've always really really liked
Takaishi-kun...

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:27.940
...even when you and him were good
friends...

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:31.730
During graduation, I asked him to
go out with me...

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.820
...And he agreed.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:38.570
He might have said that and maybe
it wasn't very official...

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.950
...but I finally became his
girlfriend...

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:45.910
...but maybe Takaishi-kun only
thinks of you in his heart...

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:50.960
Please... don't take Takaishi-kun...
don't take Takaishi-kun away from me!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.840
Please!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.220
What are you saying?

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:59.300
It's true that I used to like
Takaishi-kun...

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:02.470
...but that was in the past...

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:03.770
I'm speaking the truth...

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:07.020
Besides, I'm in love with
him now, right?

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.520
Yeah, it's a mad passionate love
like a flame!

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.900
You don't have to go that far,
dummy!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.490
Don't worry, Shizu-chan...

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.820
I won't fight you for him.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:22.530
Ok, we'll all meet here after
we're done shopping.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.460
I'm exhausted...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.250
You're here...

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:35.090
I'm a little tired...

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:38.590
Where's Shizu-chan? If you don't
look after her she'll get lost...

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.970
Matsui...

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:44.260
Sorry...
it was my misunderstanding...

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:47.270
It seems that way
but it no longer matters.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.850
Matsui, I still have
feelings for you...

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.770
What are you saying?!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.730
It's... over...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:01.740
Really? Is it really over?

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.950
There's nothing I can do
to change that?

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:14.290
There's nothing...

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:19.010
You're not important to me anymore.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.470
I see, I understand...

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.890
Goodbye! Take care!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:30.980
Come visit me again!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:33.060
Is this alright?

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:35.610
If you want to fight for him,
you still can...

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.570
It's ok.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:43.320
Ever since I came here, I've truly
forgotten what Takaishi-kun and I had.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:48.580
Then... why are you crying?

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:57.340
That's only because I got a little
sentimental thinking about the old times...

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:07.220
I can't help myself... to speak it aloud is kind of embarrassing...

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.310
Ahhh... now I get it...

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.270
You're lying...

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.980
You're so slow!

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:16.190
Sorry for bothering you!

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:20.240
- It would be nice if we can catch them...
- We're too naive...

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:22.990
Thanks for helping me out today,
Hayama.

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:26.740
You tried so hard to be with me...
I know it wasn't easy...

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:31.330
Because of you, I didn't feel as
bad as I should.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.790
Really, thank you so much.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:39.460
I'm sorry for making you do this especially when... there's a girl you like too.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.260
It's Sana...

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.050
Am I right?

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.890
But that girl is hard to
understand...

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:56.230
<i>Why? Why can others tell,
but not the person herself?</i>

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:59.360
Sana's so dense...

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:03.150
I really can't stand having no part.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.860
Uncle, I'm here!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.620
It's the restaurant that Dad always
gets take out from.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.370
You came at a good time, Fuka.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.540
You've already made a boyfriend?

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.710
Stop it, uncle!

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.170
It's about time
you guys come out too.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:19.000
We've been discovered!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.550
Did you think we wouldn't discover you?

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.130
It's a postcard sent by Sana-chan.

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:24.380
She said she's doing fine.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:26.130
Bat sushi for one person.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.220
Bat sushi, it's a specialty created by Babbit.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.010
Stop!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.720
Did you get a postcard from
Sana-chan?

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:37.900
Sana-chan only sent Fuka-chan a
postcard... how lonely...

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:41.020
I told her that when she gets
there she had to keep in touch no matter what...

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:44.690
That's the only way I could get
her to send a postcard.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:46.200
Can't this gentleman use some bat
off the street? Stop it!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:50.330
Sana-chan's not here, you must be
very lonely, right, Akito-kun?

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:59.130
Sana-chan,
the stars are very pretty.

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:01.800
Yeah, tomorrow the sky
will be clear too.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:04.260
Tomorrow we'll work hard too.
Good night!

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.670
Good night...

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:09.720
I wonder if Fuka has gotten the
postcard yet.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:13.140
Is Mama still running around
avoiding deadlines?

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:16.060
I'm not too worried about
Tsuyoshi-kun and Aya-chan.

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:17.940
Hayama...

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:20.110
