00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:21.650
I have something to tell you...

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:23.730
when you come back,
I'll tell you...

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:29.360
Maybe it's about karate?
But he already has a brown belt.

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:31.660
